p('The following five questions were sent together in a new Claude chat. The instruction limited each answer to 80 words and requested no browsing or tools. Model label: <b>Sonnet 5.5, Medium</b>. This was one shared-context run, not five independent trials. Exact server checkpoint and training overlap are unavailable.')
